    {
      "flavor_text": "せいでんきが　たまって　パチパチする\nけだまを　だいこうぶつの　きのみと\nいっしょに　みきの　あなに　かくす。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "정전기가 모여 톡톡 튀는 솜털을\n자신이 좋아하는 나무열매와 함께\n나무줄기의 구멍에 숨긴다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il roule des boules de poils pleines d’électricité\nstatique et les range dans des souches avec des\nBaies.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es bildet ein Fellknäuel, der vor statischer Energie\nknistert. Es speichert die Energie in Bäumen.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Crea bolas de pelo que crepitan con electricidad\nestática. Las almacena en agujeros de árboles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Forma delle palle di pelo cariche elettrostaticamente\ne le conserva negli alberi insieme alle bacche.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It makes fur balls that crackle with static electricity.\nIt stores them with berries in tree holes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
